silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_01_probe_catus_collision_concrete_anchor_3#mittenscolimitapex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensColimitApex is The colimit apex colim D_Mittens in the orientation page olog O_01. The probe defends this apex against identification by the bare epithet \"catus\". Mittens has ten typed legs; it is not reducible to any one source row." .
